      "writtenOn": "2025-02-27T04:12:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is a part of \"setup Teamfood and Trunkfood during mmd launch\".\n\n* OEMs who use mmd to set up zram:\n  * They are supposed to call swapon_all without zram entry fstab, or never to call swapon_all. So `mmd.enabled_aconfig` sysprop value never matters.\n* OEMs who don\u0027t use mmd to set up zram:\n  * They are free from the mmd timing to call swapon_all command. But it just shows the warning log of deprecation of swapon_all for zram setup.",
      "parentUuid": "40fd79db_920a345f",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 800,
